{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23000","headline":"自到浔阳生三女子因诠真理用遣妄怀 · 白居易","name":"自到浔阳生三女子因诠真理用遣妄怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宦途本自安身拙，世累由来向老多。\n远谪四年徒已矣，晚生三女拟如何。\n预愁嫁娶真成患，细念因缘尽是魔。\n赖学空王治苦法，须抛烦恼入头陀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}